>I've read about these rooms, but where are they ? 

At the bottom of the mines. The level where you can no more find stairs
going down. The bottom level always looks the same. You enter the level
near the top of the screen, and close to the vertical center line.
In the top left area there is a horizontal narrow corridor, and the secret
rooms are below that corridor.

>How do I get to these rooms ?
